firelock-component-is-holding-low-temperature-message = A gush of cold air blows in your face... Maybe you should reconsider.
firelock-component-is-holding-high-temperature-message = A gush of hot air blows in your face... Maybe you should reconsider.

firelock-component-examine-low-temp-warning = The [color=cyan]cold[/color] warning is active.
firelock-component-examine-extreme-low-temp-warning = The [color=cyan][bold]extreme cold[/bold][/color] safety is engaged.

firelock-component-examine-high-temp-warning = The [color=red]heat[/color] warning is active.
firelock-component-examine-extreme-high-temp-warning = The [color=red][bold]extreme heat[/bold][/color] safety is engaged.

firelock-component-examine-pressure-warning = The [color=yellow]pressure differential[/color] warning is active.
firelock-component-examine-extreme-pressure-warning = The [color=yellow][bold]pressure differential[/bold][/color] safety is engaged.
